Value Filldown SLOT (\d+)
Value Required DEVICE_ID (\d+)
Value Required STATUS (\S+)
Value AIRFLOW (.+)

Start
  ^\s*Device\s+Info\s+on\s+Slot\s+${SLOT}
  ^\s*Device\s+ID\.\s+Status -> TabularFan
  ^\s*Fan\s+${DEVICE_ID}: -> VerboseFan
  ^.*

TabularFan
  ^\s*${DEVICE_ID}\s+${STATUS}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*Device\s+Info\s+on\s+Slot\s+${SLOT}
  ^\s*Device\s+ID\.\s+Status
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*

VerboseFan
  ^\s*Fan\s+${DEVICE_ID}: -> VerboseFan
  ^\s*State\s*:\s*${STATUS}
  ^\s*Airflow\s+Direction\s*:\s*${AIRFLOW} -> Record Start
  ^\s*$$
  ^.*
